# SQL database files (real .sqlite files under data/sql/raw/, plus the
# curated databases/ symlink trees in data/sql_conceptual/ and
# data/sql_partial_sql/) are kept on shared/PVC storage, not in git -- see
# DATABASE_PATH env var in launch_scripts/initialization_script.sh.
